	<h2><a id=3D"RGB-color-space"></a>RGB color space</h2>
	<p><b>RGB color space</b> or <b>RGB color system</b>, constructs all the c=
olors from the combination of the <b>R</b>ed, <b>G</b>reen and
	<b>B</b>lue colors.</p>
	<p>The red, green and blue use 8 bits each, which have integer values from=
 0 to 255. This makes 256*256*256=3D16777216 possible colors.</p>
	<p>RGB =E2=89=A1 Red, Green, Blue</p>
	<p>Each pixel in the LED monitor displays colors this way, by combination =
of red, green and blue LEDs (light emitting diodes).</p>
	<p>When the red pixel is set to 0, the LED is turned off. When the red pix=
el is set to 255, the LED is turned fully on. </p>
	<p>Any value between them sets the LED to partial light emission.</p>

	<h2><a id=3D"rgb-format"></a>RGB color format &amp; calculation</h2>
	<p>RGB code has 24 bits format (bits 0..23):</p>
	<table id=3D"bits" class=3D"dtable">
		<tbody><tr>
			<td colspan=3D"8" style=3D"background:#FFCCCC; text-align:center; font-s=
ize:0.85em">RED[7:0]</td>
			<td colspan=3D"8" style=3D"background:#CCFFCC; text-align:center; font-s=
ize:0.85em">GREEN[7:0]</td>
			<td colspan=3D"8" style=3D"background:#CCCCFF; text-align:center; font-s=
ize:0.85em">BLUE[7:0]</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style=3D"text-align:center; font-size: 0.65em">23</td>
			<td>&nbsp;</td>
			<td>&nbsp;</td>
			<td>&nbsp;</td>
			<td>&nbsp;</td>
			<td>&nbsp;</td>
			<td>&nbsp;</td>
			<td style=3D"text-align:center; font-size:0.65em">16</td>
			<td style=3D"text-align:center; font-size:0.65em">15</td>
			<td>&nbsp;</td>
			<td>&nbsp;</td>
			<td>&nbsp;</td>
			<td>&nbsp;</td>
			<td>&nbsp;</td>
			<td>&nbsp;</td>
			<td style=3D"text-align:center; font-size:0.65em">8</td>
			<td style=3D"text-align:center; font-size:0.65em">7</td>
			<td>&nbsp;</td>
			<td>&nbsp;</td>
			<td>&nbsp;</td>
			<td>&nbsp;</td>
			<td>&nbsp;</td>
			<td>&nbsp;</td>
			<td style=3D"text-align:center; font-size:0.65em">0</td>
		</tr>
	</tbody></table>
	<p class=3D"code">RGB =3D (R*65536)+(G*256)+B , (when R is RED, G is GREEN=
 and B is BLUE)</p>
	<h4>Calculation examples</h4>
	<h5>White RGB Color</h5>
	<p class=3D"code">White RGB code =3D 255*65536+255*256+255 =3D #FFFFFF</p>
	<h5>Blue RGB Color</h5>
	<p class=3D"code">Blue RGB code =3D 0*65536+0*256+255 =3D #0000FF</p>
	<h5>Red RGB Color</h5>
	<p class=3D"code">Red RGB code =3D 255*65536+0*256+0 =3D #FF0000</p>
	<h5>Green RGB Color</h5>
	<p class=3D"code">Green RGB code =3D 0*65536+255*256+0 =3D #00FF00</p>
	<h5>Gray RGB Color</h5>
